ion:interest:cooking\"],\"interestMatches\":[{\"interestId\":\"evaluation:interest:cooking\",\"relevance\":\"direct\",\"matchReason\":\"Authored direct association with cooking.\"}]}]</candidates>\n  <recent_recommendations>[]</recent_recommendations>\n</recommendation_material>","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 200 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly states: \"关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销\" (focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles; NOT interested in restaurant store operations or kitchen appliance promotions).\n\nLooking at the candidates, I can identify several content types:\n1. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question catalog\n2. **操作记录** (operation records) - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparisons, adjustment steps\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, and food structure affect texture\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - describes local food history, festivals, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - analyzes chain restaurant store location, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance package discounts\n\nThe interest explicitly excludes restaurant business operations and kitchen appliance promotions. The **市场观察** (market observation) content type clearly falls into this excluded category - it analyzes \"连锁餐饮门店选址、加盟合同和外卖促销，并展示厨电套餐的折扣规则与销售话术\" (chain restaurant store location, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance package discounts and sales pitches).\n\nSo I should exclude all **市场观察** candidates.\n\nThe **专题观察** content type describes \"地方饮食的历史、节庆习俗和餐桌礼仪，记录菜名的演变与民间故事\" (local food history, festival customs, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories). This is somewhat tangential to the interest in reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. It's more about cultural/historical aspects. This is less aligned with the core interest.\n\nThe best matches for the interest are:\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - directly about reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing order\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - directly about cooking principles (moisture, temperature, food structure)\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - provides question catalog for further reading, somewhat relevant\n\nLet me focus on selecting candidates that align with the interest. The interest is about home cooking with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates by content type. I need 20 candidates.\n\nLet me categorize the candidates I've seen:\n\n**操作记录 (operation records)** - highly relevant (reproducible methods):\n- item-024e99402549 煎饺：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-4736b753745c 煎饺：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-58677ff38120 面团发酵：小份试做中的操作记录\n- item-5dfd02cf6e3a 清汤调味：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-693e18a58e5e 清汤调味：小份试做中的操作记录\n- item-726c16fe5955 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的操作记录\n- item-76a48bfcc5ba 煎饺：小份试做中的操作记录\n- item-793b229f835d 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-79ea9990101c 煎豆腐：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-7bd0e2754de2 炖牛肉：小份试