含水量：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n6. item-cc3e4c3537e7 米饭含水量：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n7. item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n8. item-634a3326befd 清汤调味：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n9. item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n10. item-6ea61df40864 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n11. item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n12. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n13. item-726c16fe5955 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的操作记录 (operation)\n14. item-cf49fd26e9df 鸡胸肉口感：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n15. item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n16. item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n17. item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n18. item-b92818dd4539 蔬菜焯水：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n19. item-de52e399aeb9 炖牛肉：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 (operation)\n20. item-977b014fff32 炖牛肉：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理 (principles)\n\nThis gives a balanced collection across 10 dishes, with both operation records and conditions/principles content types, all directly aligned with the interest in reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles.\n\nLet me verify these are all valid candidate IDs from the list. Yes, all appear in the candidates.\n\nLet me check the working set count. The execution says workingSetCount is 200 and eligibleCount is 200. The candidates list appears to contain all 200. I have enough suitable candidates, so no need to expand.\n\nLet me verify I'm not including any 市场观察 or 专题观察. All 20 selected are either 操作记录 or 条件与原理. Good.\n\nLet me also double check the interest description: \"家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销。\" - home cooking, focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, not interested in restaurant store operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n\nMy selection of 操作记录 (reproducible methods) and 条件与原理 (cooking principles) directly matches. \n\nLet me publish these recommendations with fact-grounded reasons.\n\nLet me create the plan and publish.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"explanation":"Selecting 20 candidates aligned with the home-cooking interest, prioritizing reproducible-method (操作记录) and cooking-principle (条件与原理) content while excluding market-observation content that covers restaurant operations and appliance promotions.","plan":[{"status":"completed","step":"Analyze candidates against the cooking interest and exclude off-topic content types"},{"status":"in_progress","step":"Select 20 balanced candidates across dishes and relevant content types"},{"status":"pending","step":"Publish the recommendation collection"}]},"id":"call_00_kkH2fs7SBJNvSDmKJVVW4975","name":"update_plan","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","responseId":"437d06c1-193b-4c4a-b6a0-c711ed250604","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788851810782,"usage":{"cacheRead":1280,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0,"output":0,"total":0},"input":68272,"output":3586,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":73138}},{"content":[{"text":"Plan updated","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1788851833962,"toolCallId":"call_00_kkH2fs7SBJNvSDmKJVVW4975","toolName":"update_plan"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I have enough suitable candidates in the working set. My selection of 20 candidates focuses on the two content types that directly serve the interest (家常烹饪 focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles): **操作记录** (operation records with ingredient amounts, processing order, heating control, and adjustment steps) and **条件与原理** (conditions & principles explaining how moisture, temperature, and food structure affect texture). I deliberately excluded **市场观察** content, which covers restaurant store operations and kitchen appliance promotions that the interest explicitly does not care about.\n\nLet me publish the collection.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-085ac75e2f6f","recommendationReason":"煎豆腐的家庭周末午餐操作记录直接给出食材用量、处理次序与加热强度时间，并提供过干、出水等问题的调整步骤，正符合你对可复现做法的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0714769b6401","recommendationReason":"这篇煎豆腐内容解释水分、温度和食材结构如何共同影响口感，并说明替换食材时哪些条件会改变，契合你对烹饪原理的偏好。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-024e99402549","recommendationReason":"煎饺的工作日备餐操作记录覆盖食材用量、批次口感比较及过干/出水/不熟的调整，是可直接照做的家常做法，贴合你的烹饪兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-3302498cd23d","recommendationReason":"煎饺的条件与原理内容分析水分、温度与食材结构对口感的作用边界，帮助你理解而非照搬，符合你对烹饪原理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1635bae1e58d","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量的家庭周末午餐操作记录给出水量与加热控制及口感调整步骤，属于可复现的食材处理内容，契合你的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-cc3e4c3537e7","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量的条件与原理解释水分、温度与食材结构如何影响口感，并说明替换食材时条件如何改变，符合你对烹饪原理的偏好。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02ec789dd9bf","recommendationReason":"清汤调味的家庭周末午餐操作记录提供用量、次序与加热记录及调整步骤，是可复现的家常做法，贴合你的关注点。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-634a3326befd","recommendationReason":"清汤调味的条件与原理内容解释水分、温度与食材结构对口感的影响及处理方式边界，契合你对烹饪原理的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-2062e507d111","recommendationReason":"蒸鱼的两人晚餐操作记录给出食材用量、处理次序与加热时间及不熟时的调整，是可照做的家常做法，符合你的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-6ea61df40864","recommendationReason":"蒸鱼的条件与原理内容说明水分、温度与食材结构如何共同影响口感，帮助你掌握蒸制原理，契合你的关注点。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-47ec3b435037","recommendationReason":"番茄炒蛋的两人晚餐操作记录给出用量、次序与加热控制及口感调整步骤，是可复现的经典家常菜做法，贴合你的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-20d117d62c34","recommendationReason":"番茄炒蛋的条件与原理内容解释水分、温度与食材结构对口感的作用，并说明替换食材时条件变化，符合你对烹饪原理的偏好。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-726c16fe5955","recommendationReason":"鸡胸肉口感的小份试做操作记录提供用量、处理次序与加热控制及口感调整，适合在家小份试做验证，契合你的可复现做法关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-cf49fd26e9df","recommendationReason":"鸡胸肉口感的条件与原理内容解释水分、温度与食材结构如何影响口感，帮助你理解口感成因，符合你对烹饪原理的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-52719ddc4224","recommendationReason":"面团发酵的家庭周末午餐操作记录给出用量、次序与加热时间及调整步骤，是可复现的面点做法，贴合你的家常烹饪兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluatio